                <title>Italy-based Tellkujira on La lucha es un poema colectivo (2026), Avant-Garde Jazz &amp; Band History</title>
                <description>Welcome to a new edition of the Neon Jazz interview series featuring Tellkujira, the Italian avant-garde collective bringing together violist Ambra, guitarists Francesco and Stefano, and cellist Francesco. We dive into their 2026 album, La lucha es un poema colectivo, explore how the quartet came together, discuss why their creative chemistry works, and discover the ideas and musical instincts behind their distinctive sound.
